    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 11 - Weekly Content Ideas Engine\nEvery Sunday you get a ready content plan for the week.\n\n1. Reads your **content pillars** and the ideas you already used (no repeats).\n2. Pulls fresh headlines from RSS feeds (n8n blog, Hacker News, The Verge AI by default).\n3. AI writes 7 balanced ideas: hook, angle, format, 3-point outline, CTA and hashtags, linking some ideas to real news.\n4. Ideas are saved to the `Ideas` tab and a brief is sent on Telegram.\n\nWorks with project **07**: move approved ideas to `Posts` and they get published automatically.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
